# Xaero's Minimap
# This is mainly a CLIENT-SIDE mod, but can also be installed on the server (NeoForge) for better multi-world waypoint support.
# 
# Download for 1.21.1 NeoForge/Forge:
# https://modrinth.com/mod/xaeros-minimap
# or CurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap
#
# Place the NeoForge/Forge 1.21.1 version jar here (mods folder).
# Players also need to install it on their client to see the minimap.
